# Normalise to LF in the repository and on checkout.
#
# Not cosmetic here: several of these projects verify that a regenerated file
# is byte-identical to the committed one. If Git rewrote line endings per
# platform, a clone on another machine would fail that check for a reason that
# has nothing to do with the code.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff2 binary
*.npy binary
*.pkl binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.zip binary
*.dta binary
